# Build context for parent-web/Dockerfile.
#
# The Dockerfile copies the whole directory, mirroring platform-admin-web's own
# .dockerignore for the identical reason: tsconfig.json's `include` lists src,
# tests, e2e, and vite -- an enumerated COPY list would have to track that array
# forever.
#
# So the directory goes in and this file takes out what must not: install and
# build output the image rebuilds itself, local test artefacts, and anything
# secret-shaped.

node_modules
dist
test-results
playwright-report
coverage

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.publishsettings
id_rsa*

.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
*.log
.DS_Store
README.md
